</div></main>
<footer class="doc"><div class="wrap">
  <div><b>Source documents.</b> Requirements come from each school's own competency manual or published list, with page citations where the manual gives them. Where this app and the manual disagree, the manual governs.</div>
  <div><b>Status is calculated, not stored.</b> Every status on these pages is worked out each time the page loads from three things: the requirements, the progress recorded against them, and today's date.</div>
  <div><b>Not a patient record.</b> No chart numbers, no patient names, no images of patients. Those belong in axiUm.</div>
</div></footer>
